'" Sensor fusion example `sensor_fusion.cpp`
@startuml sensor_fusion
title Sensor fusion: relative angle estimation with mixed sensor sets
actor System as Main
participant "Example (sensor_fusion)" as Example
participant "RelativeAngleEstimator" as Relative
participant "OrientationEstimator<9-axis>" as Left
participant "OrientationEstimator<6-axis>" as Right
participant "Quaternion<float>" as Quaternion

Main -> Example: run()
Example -> Relative: capture_reference_pose()
loop streaming sample pairs
  Example -> Left: update(Imu9Sample)
  Left -> Quaternion: align tilt + heading
  Example -> Right: update(Imu6Sample)
  Right -> Quaternion: integrate gyro + accel correction
  Example -> Relative: compute()
  Relative -> Example: hinge twist + drift/confidence
  Example -> Relative: compute_scalar(tilt_angle)
  Relative -> Example: secondary scalar output
end
Example -> Main: print drift-aware summary

note right
  The maintained example uses the public
  sensor_fusion.hpp API directly.
  Mixed 9-axis/6-axis pairs can publish
  heading-derived outputs with drift metadata.
end note
@enduml
